    "description": "*The Spear of Justice Plays*\n\nYes! I know I did it again! Shortly after making Papyrus' sheet I did Undyne. <.< Darnit!But to be fair I do rather adore her! She was the most shocking character in UT to like considering she's the first that tries to passionately kill you!  \n\n....But I came to admire her after all that. She's so passionate and strong it's hard not to see her as the true hero of Undertale. No wonder she's one of the only monsters who can not only put herself back together while dying BUT can transcend to a true level of epicness....well not if you're the one fighting her I suppose! XD \n\nAnywho I am STILL NOT making an Undertale fan game.  SO DON'T SAY I AM! NGYAAAAH!\n\nXD Oh and I shouldn't pick on Katia and Slip but honestly it was all I had for the sprite toon! Sorry guys!\n\nKatia: \"I quote Sans: 'on days like this kids like you should be BURNING IN HELL!' Wise frellin' man that Sans.\" >-<;\n\nSlip: \"Kappa!\"\n\nUndyne:   \"What do you punks think you're doing missing your cooking lessons!\" *Spear summoning sounds* \"Back to it! Hyup two three four! Stir harder! More fire! Whahahaha!\" \n\n  \"Uh oh\" *Explodey sounds*",
